  "_commit": {
    "id": "01d5f3a9577792a71f088db7822d01ca3898f1e0",
    "author": "Ruining Dong <lnyidrn@gmail.com>",
    "committer": "Ruining Dong <lnyidrn@gmail.com>",
    "message": "Fix gene symbol lookup for Ensembl transcript IDs in newer TxDb\n\nRoot cause: TxDb.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg19.knownGene now uses Ensembl transcript IDs\n(ENST...) instead of UCSC IDs (uc...). The static gene_symbol.txt lookup table\nonly mapped UCSC kgIDs to gene symbols, so all gene symbols resolved to NA.\n\nFix:\n- Update .txs2genesym() to handle both UCSC and Ensembl transcript IDs\n  - First tries static UCSC lookup table (backward compatible)\n  - Falls back to dynamic TxDb + org.Hs.eg.db lookup for Ensembl IDs\n- Pass genes TxDb to .txs2genesym() from eventDetection.R\n- Add AnnotationDbi to Imports, org.Hs.eg.db to Suggests\n- Replace dplyr::as_tibble with as.data.frame for Hits objects\n- Clean up vignette diagnostic code\n- Bump version to 1.17.5\n",
    "time": 1771376705
  },
